WEBVTT

00:13.700 --> 00:17.470
What are you doing here, Milim?

00:20.540 --> 00:25.340
It looked like you were doing
something fun here, so I stopped by.

00:25.340 --> 00:29.430
You've sure got some nerve to leave me
behind on some fun, Rimuru!

00:29.430 --> 00:31.640
- Hey...
- Heh. Milim, huh?

00:31.990 --> 00:35.140
Seems like this noble work
performed by grown-ups

00:35.140 --> 00:37.930
is far too complex
for children like you.

00:37.930 --> 00:41.150
This is not a playground.
Stay out of our way!

00:41.150 --> 00:43.020
Master is right!

00:43.020 --> 00:47.780
We're doing our job over here,
so you should go play elsewhere!

00:49.270 --> 00:52.370
What do you mean it looks fun?

00:52.370 --> 00:56.950
I'm planning a huge festival because
you sent me this letter, remember?

00:56.950 --> 00:57.870
What?

00:57.870 --> 01:01.330
So you weren't ignoring my letter?

01:01.330 --> 01:03.040
Of course not.

01:03.040 --> 01:08.300
Since I'm inviting Demon Lords,
I can't just do it normally, can I?

01:08.300 --> 01:11.300
Wait a minute, Rimuru!
I'm a Demon Lord, too, you know!

01:11.300 --> 01:14.470
I'm part of the Octagram
with you and Milim!

01:14.470 --> 01:18.190
How can I even invite you after
you decided to just up and move here?!

01:18.980 --> 01:21.980
What?! You moved here?!
What's that supposed to mean?!

01:21.980 --> 01:25.270
Don't tell me, Ramiris,
are you living with Rimuru?!

01:25.270 --> 01:25.940
What?

01:26.280 --> 01:31.150
Oh, that's right.
I don't even need to get invited!

01:31.150 --> 01:34.740
I'm not a loner any longer,
and I'm living with Rimuru and everything, too!

01:38.870 --> 01:42.790
No fair! No fair!
I wanna live here, too!

01:42.790 --> 01:45.670
Ha-ha! Tough luck!
I've got a job here, remember?

01:45.670 --> 01:47.420
I'm helping out Rimuru!

01:47.420 --> 01:50.630
I'm not some unwelcome house guest
who causes trouble like you!

01:50.630 --> 01:53.970
What? How dare you say that!
Why, I oughtta...

01:57.140 --> 01:58.740
That's enough!

01:59.470 --> 02:02.730
No sweets for anyone who's bickering!

02:03.980 --> 02:06.230
W-We're good friends!

02:06.230 --> 02:07.480
Right?

02:12.820 --> 02:14.270
Good job, Shuna.

03:16.630 --> 03:23.180
THAT TIME I GOT REINCARNATED AS A SLIME

03:45.500 --> 03:47.870
EPISODE 63: THE AUDIENCE
You may give me a job as well!

03:47.870 --> 03:50.880
But will those under you
be okay with that?

03:50.880 --> 03:54.340
Did you get permission from Mr. Carrion
or Ms. Frey to come here?

03:55.840 --> 03:57.220
Um, yeah...

03:57.220 --> 04:00.060
Well, y'know, I'm really smart and stuff,

04:00.060 --> 04:03.140
so it's not like I ran away 'cause
I don't like studying or anything!

04:03.140 --> 04:04.520
Stare...

04:04.520 --> 04:07.600
No! Don't say it! I'll stay here
and help you, and that's that!

04:07.600 --> 04:09.810
You're the one who's
gonna get yelled at anyway,

04:09.810 --> 04:12.070
so let's set that aside for now.

04:12.070 --> 04:14.090
So what about those dragons
you mentioned?

04:14.090 --> 04:19.529
You said you could capture them
and bring them over, didn't you?

04:19.529 --> 04:21.529
Is that really possible?

04:22.660 --> 04:24.790
Will they really yell at me after this?

04:24.790 --> 04:26.790
Eh, whatever!

04:26.790 --> 04:29.580
They do say there's no adventuring
without a little danger!

04:29.580 --> 04:31.460
So dragons, huh?

04:31.460 --> 04:33.500
Sure, you can capture them just fine.

04:33.500 --> 04:36.010
In fact, how 'bout I do it for ya?

04:36.010 --> 04:39.510
And like that, I asked Milim
to capture some dragons for me...

04:39.950 --> 04:41.300
Earth Dragon.

04:41.300 --> 04:42.890
Wind Dragon.

04:42.890 --> 04:44.430
Ice Dragon.

04:44.430 --> 04:45.640
Fire Dragon.

04:45.640 --> 04:49.440
We captured those four dragons
and released them in the dungeon.

04:50.230 --> 04:52.650
Thanks to the magicule Veldora released,

04:52.650 --> 04:55.360
monsters started spawning
inside the dungeon...

04:55.360 --> 04:58.030
...and the installation of
the traps went well.

05:01.700 --> 05:02.990
Step on the next one.

05:02.990 --> 05:04.730
All right, got it!

05:10.710 --> 05:12.830
Great Rimuru!

05:12.830 --> 05:14.540
I'm sorry we didn't make it here sooner.

05:14.540 --> 05:16.550
I'll be in your care starting today!

05:16.550 --> 05:18.760
And long time no see, Sir Rigurd!

05:18.760 --> 05:22.090
Hey, Mjöllmile, thanks so much for coming!

05:22.930 --> 05:25.970
Looks like the preparation
has progressed pretty far.

05:25.970 --> 05:30.140
I also see quite a lot of people
coming from outside the town.

05:30.140 --> 05:32.020
All thanks to you.

05:32.020 --> 05:35.940
Whoa! What a marvelous arena!

05:35.940 --> 05:38.320
So yeah, this is what
we've been working on.

05:38.680 --> 05:42.990
It's a tremendous relief to have
Sir Mjöllmile with us on this.

05:42.990 --> 05:44.160
I know, right?

05:44.160 --> 05:46.580
If this Founder's Festival ends well,

05:46.580 --> 05:50.290
I'm thinking about making him
our nation's chief financial manager.

05:50.290 --> 05:52.210
That's a splendid idea!

05:52.210 --> 05:54.830
No, no, I still have much to learn.

05:55.330 --> 06:00.260
But I promise you that I, Mjöllmile,
will work on this with everything I have!

06:10.270 --> 06:13.730
Unbelievable! This is unbelievable!

06:13.730 --> 06:16.740
Even when compared to the luxury
lodging in the Engrassia capital...

06:17.370 --> 06:21.030
...this house is far posher!

06:21.030 --> 06:23.320
Thanks for guarding them here, Gobuemon.

06:23.320 --> 06:25.320
Were there any issues on the way here?

06:25.320 --> 06:27.450
Yes, sir. Well...

06:27.450 --> 06:31.200
We were really saved thanks
to you sending him to protect us.

06:31.200 --> 06:32.460
Actually...

06:41.130 --> 06:42.760
It was a vicious monster.

06:43.150 --> 06:47.350
Perhaps Viscount Cazac was behind that,
as a way to get back at me.

06:49.100 --> 06:53.310
Gobuemon, I want you to continue
to guard Mjöllmile for now.

06:53.660 --> 06:55.440
Understood, Lord Rimuru!

06:55.860 --> 06:57.440
Will that be okay, Mjöllmile?

06:57.440 --> 06:59.400
Yes, of course!

06:59.400 --> 07:03.030
In fact, I was thinking of
asking that myself!

07:04.820 --> 07:06.610
An attack, huh.

07:07.160 --> 07:10.330
The town's protected by Shuna's barrier,

07:10.330 --> 07:13.370
but perhaps I should enforce
the defense at the highway.

07:15.080 --> 07:19.670
Well then, let's hear the progress
from each one of you on your projects.

07:20.340 --> 07:21.360
Great Rimuru.

07:21.360 --> 07:23.530
There's one thing I'd like
to consult you about.

07:23.530 --> 07:25.760
Hm? What is it, Rigurd?

07:26.130 --> 07:29.220
The representatives from
the tribes in the Jura Forest

07:29.220 --> 07:31.560
had already gathered in the town.

07:31.560 --> 07:34.230
They're all here to celebrate
your appointment as a Demon Lord,

07:34.230 --> 07:37.020
or perhaps to ascertain
the power you wield.

07:37.530 --> 07:42.530
Their goal is to vow their loyalty to you,
the Demon Lord, and earn your protection.

07:42.910 --> 07:45.740
But if they find your power to be lacking,

07:45.740 --> 07:49.060
they will immediately turn their
fangs on you and start a revolt.

07:50.370 --> 07:52.240
Until now, the Great Forest of Jura

07:52.240 --> 07:56.000
had been protected under
Lord Veldora's tremendous power.

07:56.000 --> 08:00.880
But now a new Demon Lord had taken
this impregnable territory as his.

08:00.880 --> 08:02.090
I see.

08:02.090 --> 08:05.670
And this Demon Lord is still just an upstart,
whose character is a mystery.

08:05.670 --> 08:08.050
Of course they'd feel unnerved.

08:08.550 --> 08:13.060
As such, we're thinking we should
hold an audience ceremony.

08:13.060 --> 08:14.720
Audience ceremony?

08:18.940 --> 08:20.980
It looks great on you, Great Rimuru!

08:20.980 --> 08:25.280
The audience ceremony will be held
starting this afternoon for three days.

08:25.280 --> 08:26.820
Good luck!

08:26.820 --> 08:31.370
Sir Diablo and Sir Hakuro
still weren't back from Falmuth,

08:31.370 --> 08:35.240
but they were very disappointed
to miss your glorious moment!

08:35.909 --> 08:39.330
They got to handle Youm's own coronation
over there, too, after all.

08:40.080 --> 08:42.000
The old name of "Falmuth" is gone,

08:42.000 --> 08:44.169
and a new nation will be born
in its place.

08:44.610 --> 08:47.430
I'm sure there are tons of things
they need to do over there.

08:48.630 --> 08:51.840
I'm not the only one suffering right now.

08:51.840 --> 08:54.930
It's a little embarrassing,
but I should give it my best.

09:13.950 --> 09:16.330
Yeah, this is embarrassing.

09:18.000 --> 09:20.710
The audience ceremony will now begin!

09:23.460 --> 09:26.300
Oh, Abiru!

09:26.300 --> 09:29.010
It has been so long since
we last spoke, Great Rimuru.

09:29.010 --> 09:32.340
It pleases me, er, all of us, greatly...

09:32.340 --> 09:35.350
...for the momentous occasion
you have granted us.

09:35.700 --> 09:38.020
No need for formalities here.

09:38.020 --> 09:40.890
We're all part of the same federation,
aren't we?

09:40.890 --> 09:42.980
Keep up the good work.

09:42.980 --> 09:45.150
It is not that simple, Great Rimuru.

09:45.150 --> 09:48.110
There, there. Gabiru is working hard
under my leadership.

09:48.110 --> 09:50.780
He's now working as part of
my department of development.

09:50.780 --> 09:52.030
Isn't that right, Gabiru?

09:52.030 --> 09:52.860
What?!

09:54.740 --> 09:56.120
Yes, sir!

09:57.790 --> 09:59.370
That stupid kid of mine...

10:02.120 --> 10:03.650
Sir Gabiru!

10:03.650 --> 10:05.380
I'm so glad you earned
his forgiveness!

10:05.380 --> 10:06.450
Indeed!

10:07.500 --> 10:09.670
Next is the final group of the day!

10:10.380 --> 10:12.510
Ms. Trya and Ms. Tris?

10:12.510 --> 10:14.300
Long time no see.
Doing well?

10:14.300 --> 10:15.340
Great Rimuru.

10:15.340 --> 10:17.180
We have important matters to discuss.

10:17.180 --> 10:18.260
Huh?

10:21.180 --> 10:24.310
Ahhh, Lady Ramiris, you are so ravishing!

10:24.310 --> 10:27.650
As beautiful as always, and so elegant!

10:28.030 --> 10:30.730
The perfect master for us to serve!

10:31.530 --> 10:34.660
Did you hear that?
Hey, did you hear that?!

10:34.660 --> 10:38.030
I bet you see me
in a new light now, huh, don't you?

10:38.030 --> 10:39.950
Well, Ramiris?

10:39.950 --> 10:44.480
It looks to me all the treants want
to serve you, too, not just these two.

10:49.800 --> 10:51.210
But...

10:51.210 --> 10:54.010
How about we have them
move into your labyrinth?

10:54.630 --> 10:58.010
Are you sure? In that case,
I'll head out as soon as tomorrow!

10:58.010 --> 11:01.520
Expanding this labyrinth was a snap
when I borrowed some power from Master,

11:01.520 --> 11:04.230
and I feel like
I've gained some power, too.

11:04.230 --> 11:07.770
There are some empty floors left,
so maybe we can make a jungle section!

11:07.770 --> 11:11.710
But as creatures who live
in the Forest of Jura,

11:11.710 --> 11:14.150
shouldn't they be placed under
your ruling, Sir Rimuru?

11:14.150 --> 11:17.320
The labyrinth is within Ramiris's rule.

11:17.320 --> 11:19.990
It's outside of my jurisdiction.
It's completely fine.

11:22.830 --> 11:24.890
We, the treants and dryads,

11:24.890 --> 11:27.750
wish to reposition ourselves
under the protection of Lady Ramiris.

11:27.750 --> 11:31.250
We know it is selfish of us, but would
we be able to receive your permission?

11:31.680 --> 11:33.510
Yeah. You have my permission.

11:35.970 --> 11:37.890
Yay!

11:39.180 --> 11:42.010
You even prepared
a paradise like this for us...

11:42.010 --> 11:44.850
I'm sure everyone else
will love living here.

11:45.430 --> 11:47.790
Please allow us to do something
to pay you for this.

11:47.790 --> 11:52.150
Then can I have you girls
help manage the labyrinth?

11:52.150 --> 11:53.480
Of course!

12:02.490 --> 12:04.410
You guys stay out of this!

12:04.870 --> 12:08.620
Same goes for you guys. I'm shocked you
dare to show that face to the Demon Lord.

12:08.620 --> 12:11.170
Huh?!

12:11.170 --> 12:13.000
Huuuh?!

12:16.760 --> 12:18.470
Hey, Demon Lord!

12:18.470 --> 12:21.430
If you want a stout ally in battle,
turn to us first!

12:21.430 --> 12:25.790
Let the Gozu join your side, and you'll get
to strut around the forest with authority!

12:25.790 --> 12:28.350
And once we wipe out those
wimpy Mezus once and for all,

12:28.350 --> 12:31.560
you won't find any race
in the forest to defy us!

12:31.910 --> 12:35.280
True, there are a few
A rankers in the group.

12:35.280 --> 12:39.660
In terms of pure fighting ability,
they may be the best Jura had to offer.

12:39.660 --> 12:41.620
Heh! You moron!

12:41.620 --> 12:44.280
A Demon Lord would know better
which side is better!

12:44.280 --> 12:47.330
There's nothing to worry about!
Go ahead and side with us Mezus!

12:47.330 --> 12:48.990
Not just these dumb Gozus,

12:48.990 --> 12:51.880
we'll wipe the floor
with anyone who dares to defy us!

12:52.800 --> 12:57.010
These guys are like minotaurs
from Greek mythology...

12:57.010 --> 13:00.130
And nothing fits better for
minotaurs than a labyrinth.

13:00.130 --> 13:04.180
Maybe these guys could serve well
as the bosses at the dungeon?

13:04.180 --> 13:09.100
But it's clear they simply wanted me
as a leverage to annihilate the other side.

13:09.100 --> 13:12.020
All right, I'll release Lord's Ambition
to humble them a little.

13:16.360 --> 13:17.150
Huh?

13:18.820 --> 13:23.320
You two! How dare you show
such rudeness before our lord!

13:23.320 --> 13:26.160
I, Rigurd, will show you your place!

13:26.160 --> 13:29.250
What? A mere bureaucrat
thinks he's some big shot, eh?

13:29.250 --> 13:32.670
You're nothing but Demon Lord's flunky,
so shut the hell up!

13:33.130 --> 13:35.540
They didn't even notice
my Lord's Ambition?

13:35.540 --> 13:38.210
Looks like they're so hot-tempered
they critically lack

13:38.210 --> 13:40.510
the ability to detect
things around them.

13:44.140 --> 13:46.140
Shuna's barrier got broken?!

13:47.430 --> 13:48.390
This is...

13:48.390 --> 13:51.020
Good grief, some trouble?

13:51.500 --> 13:53.900
Hmph, not a problem.

13:53.900 --> 13:57.520
I feel a tremendous wave of energy.
Do you think it's from a Majin?

13:57.520 --> 14:00.690
It doesn't seem like they're
coming for some friendly chat.

14:02.530 --> 14:05.200
S-Such power...

14:05.990 --> 14:10.500
Wh-Whoa, Demon Lord,
are others of your kind coming to attack?

14:11.790 --> 14:12.750
Let's go!

14:12.750 --> 14:13.720
Yes, sir!

14:20.420 --> 14:21.470
Gobzo!

14:22.590 --> 14:23.800
Great Rimuru!

14:24.930 --> 14:26.350
What are you guys doing?

14:26.350 --> 14:29.930
You realize you've perpetrated this violence
in the domain of the Demon Lord Rimuru?

14:33.390 --> 14:34.600
Outta the way!

14:34.600 --> 14:36.480
I'm not here to deal with some small fries.

14:36.480 --> 14:40.090
We were planning to kill Clayman
and seize his Demon Lord spot,

14:40.090 --> 14:43.070
but someone got in our way,
and we're pissed off about it right now.

14:43.070 --> 14:44.990
I won't kill anyone for no reason,

14:44.990 --> 14:47.970
but if you get in my way,
I ain't gonna go easy!

14:51.450 --> 14:52.450
True.

14:52.960 --> 14:57.130
Although they're overwhelmingly
more powerful, nobody here died.

14:57.130 --> 15:00.300
He must've been telling the truth.

15:00.800 --> 15:04.380
That said, it's not like I can just
leave these guys be.

15:05.630 --> 15:07.920
Wait, Great Rimuru.

15:08.550 --> 15:10.140
Let me handle this.

15:10.140 --> 15:11.140
Huh?!

15:11.810 --> 15:14.890
Oh, you one of Demon Lord Rimuru's aides?

15:15.520 --> 15:19.520
You must be the female Kijin who whipped
Clayman's butt that Dad told me about.

15:19.520 --> 15:22.940
I like it.
Let's warm up with you first...

15:22.940 --> 15:24.700
Wait, Big Bro.

15:24.700 --> 15:27.990
We'll let you have the Demon Lord,
so let us duke with his aides.

15:29.160 --> 15:30.450
Yes, yes!

15:30.450 --> 15:34.200
I'm getting hungry, you know.
I could take on one or two.

15:34.200 --> 15:36.540
These guys are brothers?

15:36.540 --> 15:40.090
Their energy levels are equivalent
to a pre-awakened Clayman.

15:40.840 --> 15:43.380
Their father must've been a demon lord.

15:43.920 --> 15:45.720
But who could it be?

15:46.070 --> 15:46.840
You three!

15:48.330 --> 15:51.180
Great Rimuru is busy
with his audience ceremony right now.

15:51.180 --> 15:54.770
To save time,
I will handle all three of you at once.

15:54.770 --> 15:55.430
Huh?!

15:55.430 --> 15:58.600
Whoa, are you picking on us?

15:58.600 --> 16:02.150
I was thinking of going easy on you
since you're a girl, but forget it.

16:02.150 --> 16:05.100
I'm gonna make you cry, I swear.

16:06.200 --> 16:08.690
That sass is like a punch in the gut.

16:08.690 --> 16:11.700
Seems like you're gonna make me feel
the fullest I've been in a while!

16:12.090 --> 16:13.200
It's too reckless.

16:13.200 --> 16:17.080
Taking on three foes more powerful
than you at the same time...

16:17.080 --> 16:18.620
B-Benimaru?

16:18.620 --> 16:20.040
Just let her do what she wants.

16:20.580 --> 16:23.840
Shion is far more suited
to holding back than me.

16:23.840 --> 16:24.760
What?

16:25.960 --> 16:27.970
I guess I have no choice.

16:28.590 --> 16:30.090
Hold up!

16:30.090 --> 16:32.600
It'd be bad to duke it out here,
so let's move elsewhere.

16:45.480 --> 16:47.280
Hey, lady.

16:47.280 --> 16:51.740
You got guts, but if you wanna take back
what you said, now's the time.

16:51.740 --> 16:56.750
Let me show you energy levels aren't
the only deciding factor in a battle!

17:31.780 --> 17:33.240
B-Benimaru?

17:33.240 --> 17:34.620
Shion's...

17:34.620 --> 17:36.620
Yes, this is quite a surprise.

17:36.620 --> 17:38.410
She's gotten better at holding back.

17:38.410 --> 17:41.710
That's not what I'm talking about!
Like, no joke, she's strong!

17:41.710 --> 17:43.580
I mean, almost too strong,
don't you think?

17:44.750 --> 17:47.500
I'm sorry, was that not enough?

17:47.500 --> 17:48.800
Then I'll go more...

17:48.800 --> 17:50.840
No, no, that's fine!

17:52.970 --> 17:56.640
If you guys have learned your lesson,
stop getting in our way, okay?

17:56.640 --> 17:59.430
Also, the other Demon Lords
are even worse than that,

17:59.430 --> 18:01.850
so try not to fall out
of line again, okay?

18:01.850 --> 18:04.990
She's even stronger than Dad said.

18:05.650 --> 18:08.650
Big Bro, that means
Demon Lord Rimuru is...

18:08.650 --> 18:11.900
Yeah, he's even stronger!

18:13.660 --> 18:15.660
I'm getting hungry!

18:15.660 --> 18:18.740
So who sent you three here?

18:19.830 --> 18:23.670
Ah, yes! We're the sons of
the Demon Lord Daggrull.

18:24.210 --> 18:26.170
I'm the eldest, Daggra!

18:26.710 --> 18:28.340
I'm the second oldest, Liura.

18:28.880 --> 18:30.960
I'm the youngest son, Chonkra.

18:35.890 --> 18:37.640
Daggrull?

18:39.430 --> 18:43.440
Hey, is it okay for you to reveal
your identities like that?

18:43.440 --> 18:49.360
Yes, Dad actually ordered us
to go train under you.

18:49.360 --> 18:53.200
We caused a little ruckus back home,
but he got royally mad.

18:53.900 --> 18:55.450
So he kicked us out.

18:56.070 --> 18:59.740
That's why he's forcing
his problem children on me?

18:59.740 --> 19:03.710
What the hell? It's not like we knew
each other that well or anything.

19:03.710 --> 19:07.580
But well, I suppose I could
make him owe me a favor with this.

19:08.090 --> 19:09.380
All right.

19:09.380 --> 19:12.550
Let's have you train under Shion, then.

19:13.380 --> 19:16.340
Shion, I'm sorry, but can you
take care of them for me?

19:19.180 --> 19:22.720
I have received my orders
from Great Rimuru.

19:22.720 --> 19:25.940
Just listen to my words and I can even
take a pack of weaklings like you

19:25.940 --> 19:28.190
and build you into first-rate warriors!

19:28.190 --> 19:29.820
You may follow me with confidence!

19:29.820 --> 19:32.280
Yes, I'd hope for nothing else!

19:32.280 --> 19:36.860
Yeah! I'll do my best
under your guidance, Big Sis!

19:36.860 --> 19:38.200
Me too!

19:38.200 --> 19:40.740
But can you give me
something to eat first?

19:40.740 --> 19:44.660
Good! I'll expect all of you
to follow my commands to the letter!

19:45.870 --> 19:47.120
Are you sure?

19:47.120 --> 19:48.960
Just let her do whatever she wants.

19:50.000 --> 19:52.340
W-We were awaiting your return!

19:52.340 --> 19:56.340
Our loyalty shall forever
be with you, Great Rimuru!

19:59.130 --> 19:59.930
What?

19:59.930 --> 20:02.930
Seems like they saw the earlier fight.

20:05.850 --> 20:09.690
After that, the audience
proceeded smoothly.

20:12.730 --> 20:17.900
Elves' life spans are said to be between
five and eight hundred years, right?

20:17.900 --> 20:21.200
He's the elder, but he only
looks like a young man to me.

20:21.620 --> 20:24.740
It is an honor to lay eyes upon you.

20:24.740 --> 20:28.920
We have come here today to celebrate
you and offer our heartfelt gratitude.

20:28.920 --> 20:32.960
Gratitude? But this is
the first time we met, right?

20:32.960 --> 20:34.960
It's about the Gozus and Mezus.

20:35.670 --> 20:38.760
Their tribes have been at war
for a hundred years,

20:38.760 --> 20:42.220
and the area of the forest where we live
has suffered from their conflict.

20:42.220 --> 20:44.880
The forest's animals and monsters
fled for their lives,

20:44.880 --> 20:47.530
the fruits and vegetables died
before they could be harvested,

20:47.530 --> 20:50.400
and some of us even resorted to
taking work in the Dwarven Kingdom.

20:50.400 --> 20:51.730
I see.

20:51.730 --> 20:54.940
We had reluctantly
considered moving elsewhere,

20:54.940 --> 20:57.650
but even in the vast land
of the Great Forest of Jura,

20:57.650 --> 21:00.740
finding a new place to live
was proven to be a challenge.

21:00.740 --> 21:02.740
Hm. I see.

21:02.740 --> 21:09.120
Thus, we considered appealing to you
to do something about those violent thugs.

21:09.120 --> 21:13.080
But before we could, you had
already given your judgment.

21:13.080 --> 21:16.510
Now all we need is to secure
a place to move to...

21:16.870 --> 21:18.760
Hm? Wait...

21:21.990 --> 21:23.800
How many are you guys?

21:23.800 --> 21:25.680
Around three hundred.

21:25.680 --> 21:29.480
Elder, I think I know someplace
that'd be able to accept you.

21:29.480 --> 21:32.440
O-Oh! You do, Lord Rimuru?

21:32.440 --> 21:35.110
Mm-hmm.
We'd be able to fit you all in!

21:35.110 --> 21:36.820
Thank you so much!

21:36.820 --> 21:40.610
I will inform my people
of this the moment I return.

21:40.610 --> 21:43.240
Can I ask you guys to do
some work for me in return?

21:43.240 --> 21:45.370
Of course, my lord.

21:45.370 --> 21:51.370
If our powers can be of help to you,
nothing could make us happier!

21:52.120 --> 21:57.500
Now all I can hope for is for those
who had not come back to return to us.

21:57.500 --> 21:59.380
Not come back?

21:59.380 --> 22:00.450
Yes, my lord.

22:00.450 --> 22:04.170
Some of us left for work
but did not return.

22:04.640 --> 22:07.090
We elves are tightly knit.

22:07.090 --> 22:09.770
I find it hard to imagine
they would abandon their homeland.

22:12.980 --> 22:15.770
An elf slave, huh?

22:15.770 --> 22:18.400
Some people out there sure
come out with terrible things.

22:20.610 --> 22:21.570
Soei.

22:21.570 --> 22:25.120
I want you to investigate a man
named Viscount Cazac in Blumund.

22:25.120 --> 22:26.160
Yes, sir.

22:30.790 --> 22:32.080
The third day.

22:32.080 --> 22:34.080
It's finally coming to an end.

22:34.080 --> 22:36.380
Geld, Diablo.
I'm glad to see you two back.

22:36.380 --> 22:37.340
Yes, sir.

22:37.340 --> 22:41.420
Thanks to the break you're giving me,
I'm now able to see you in your glory.

22:41.420 --> 22:43.090
Great Rimuru!

22:43.090 --> 22:45.680
You are as stately
and dignified as always.

22:45.680 --> 22:50.520
I feel like my heart would burst with joy
at being able to see you again!

22:50.520 --> 22:54.230
I would love to hear
the report about Falmuth,

22:54.230 --> 22:58.020
but today's audience might be
the toughest one yet.

22:58.020 --> 23:01.940
After all, it will be with...

23:02.470 --> 23:04.280
...the Tengu.

24:36.000 --> 24:38.830
Next time,
"Benimaru's Ordeal."
